  "releaseNotes": "feat(session): add identity-based credential and permission authorization\n\n      - Rename internal user session model to identity terminology\n      - Add CreateCredential API for automatic token generation and binding\n      - Support GUID-based credential creation with TTL expiration\n      - Improve authorization flow with per-identity permission locking\n      - Use HashSet permissions for O(1) permission lookup\n      - Add RequireAllPermissions support for AND/OR permission policies\n      - Keep session middleware internal with framework-controlled execution",
